# The repository-wide `*.log` rule exists to keep runtime logs (multi-MB
# llama-server / driver logs under SPEECHRL_DATA_DIR) out of Git. The five
# `*.log` files in this directory are not runtime logs: they are the stdout
# transcripts of the one-shot salvage derivation itself, i.e. the evidence this
# archive exists to preserve. Re-include them here only.
!*.log
